        }
      ],
      "notes": "The verdict is broadly sound. Direction (worsens) is well-supported: the policy is explicitly unfunded per the evidence, and O12 criteria treat unfunded tax cuts symmetrically with unfunded spending. The rationale is transparent about the Labour-source limitation on the cost estimate. No lever leakage, no party-blind issues, no false balance \u2014 the worsens direction is genuinely one-sided given absence of any funding plan in the evidence."
